# Working ledger

Outstanding / ready-to-ship work for the active release lives in [WORKING.md](WORKING.md). Canonical version: [VERSION.md](VERSION.md).

- **Start** release or issue work → read `WORKING.md` + `VERSION.md` (and the [working-files skill](.cursor/skills/working-files/SKILL.md)).
- **Version check** → if the new work needs a different semver than the open release line and Ready-to-ship (or unreleased work) exists, **recommend shipping a PR first**; do not mix versions on one branch.
- **Finish** an issue or end a coding chat → update `WORKING.md` (Ready to ship / In progress / notes). Do not rely on chat history alone.
- **Open a PR** → follow [github-prs skill](.cursor/skills/github-prs/SKILL.md): QA → VERSION sync → Ready-to-ship `Closes` → **ask human** → only then create.
- Never `gh issue close` for PR-bound work — close via PR `Closes #N` only.
